dlsentinel (0.1.0~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Six scanners with 88 rules: secrets, dependencies, source code,
    container and infrastructure configuration, API definitions and
    smart contracts.
  * 76 rules carry CWE and OWASP Top 10 (2021) compliance mappings.
  * Reports as terminal output, JSON, Markdown or SARIF 2.1.0.
  * Baselines and suppression rules, so an existing codebase can adopt the
    scanner and fail only on newly introduced findings.
  * Infrastructure graph (sentinel graph) and attack-path correlation
    (sentinel scan --paths).
  * CI-friendly exit codes: 0 clean, 1 policy violated, 2 error, 64 usage.

